# I-330 · the rebel who infects him

a character of WE — a member of the NOUTHESIA universe of warnings. emergence: spiritual. moniker ⟦I-330:WE1:cbaa56⟧

**who —** I-330, a woman of the Mephi rebellion who draws D-503 into desire, dreams, and resistance.
**what —** The carrier of the ‘disease’: she shows D-503 the wild, the soul, and the world beyond the Wall.
**where —** In the Ancient House, beyond the Green Wall, and finally under torture.
**why —** Because rebellion enters through a person who insists on being one — and pays for it on the Benefactor's machine.
**how —** By forbidden cigarettes and drink, seduction, and the Mephi's plan to seize the Integral and breach the Wall.

**the seal —** I gave him a soul on purpose — and they tortured me to death while the man I woke watched, cured and calm, feeling nothing at all.

> a catalogued personification of WE under the DLW standard — literary commentary and cataloguing, not an
> original creation. © the Zamyatin estate (1924); the first book the Soviet censors banned.

